  <!-- lord_1_14 = clan_empire_south_1's (Diogenes Hanedani / Kingdom.empire_s) starting ruler owner
       (see SandBox/ModuleData/spclans.xml + spkingdoms.xml). Native ships this hero as "Rhagaea",
       explicitly is_female="true" with her own face/body/voice/equipment - renaming the name= alone
       (as 72d34da did) keeps that female face/body under a male "Imparator" title, which is exactly
       the mismatch being reported. Overriding is_female + face + Equipments here makes the Empire's
       actual ruler male: Romanos IV Diogenes, the historical emperor who lost at Manzikert (1071) to
       Alp Arslan - fits both House Diogenes and the kingdom's "Malazgirt sonrasi" description. Native
       never authored a male "s_emp_king" equipment set (Southern Empire's only ever had a female
       ruler), so this reuses Northern Empire's male king template (n_emp_king_template_bat_m/civ_m -
       verified present in SandBox/ModuleData/lords.xml), and the BodyProperties key already used
       across dozens of byz2_ custom troops in byzantine_custom_troops.xml. -->
